## System Architecture
INPUT LAYER
├── Social Media Text (ZH/EN) — Weibo, Instagram
├── Self-Report Survey — PHQ-9/GAD-7
└── Contextual Metadata — Posting time/frequency
│
TIER 1: SCREENING
├── Model: Chinese MentalBERT (Ji et al., 2024)
├── Task: Binary classification (distress / no distress)
├── Languages: Mandarin (Traditional + Simplified) + English
├── Benchmark: F1=88.39% on SOS-1K Chinese suicide risk dataset
└── Output: LOW → exit pipeline | HIGH → proceed to Tier 2
│
TIER 2: RISK SCORING
├── Model: XGBoost Classifier
├── Features: Linguistic · Temporal · Social · Cultural
└── Output: Risk score 0–100 + interpretable feature weights
│
TIER 3: TEMPORAL FORECASTING
├── Model: LSTM (30-day lookback)
├── Basis: Eckstein et al. (2026) — multi-timescale memory
└── Output: 7-day risk trajectory + intervention timing
│
OUTPUT / ACTION LAYER
├── Score 0–30   LOW    → HealthHub self-care
├── Score 31–65  MEDIUM → mindline.sg + CHAT webCHAT
└── Score 66–100 HIGH   → REACH + IMH crisis pathway
HIGH outputs require human clinical review
