## Tier 3: Temporal Forecasting — Detailed Design

### Theoretical Basis
Informed by Eckstein et al. (2026): human behaviour encodes risk history at multiple timescales. The Memory-ANN framework — separating memory variables from choice variables — informs the LSTM design by distinguishing historical context features from immediate distress signals.

