## Data Governance Framework

### Privacy Principles
- **No raw text storage** after feature extraction
- **30-day rolling window** — older data auto-deleted
- **Anonymised feature vectors** only in model inputs
- **Opt-in consent** required before any data collection
- **PDPA compliance** — Singapore Personal Data Protection Act
- **Parent/guardian consent** required for users under 18

### Access Control

| Role | Access Level |
|---|---|
| Student (self) | Own risk score only |
| School Counsellor | Score + trajectory + feature summary |
| REACH Officer | Full output including clinical notes |
| Researcher | Anonymised aggregate data only |
| System Admin | Audit logs only |

---

## Validation Framework

### Key Metrics

| Metric | Target | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Sensitivity (recall) | >85% | Missing true positives is high-stakes |
| Specificity | >75% | Minimise counsellor false alarm workload |
| F1 Score | >80% | Balanced performance |
| AUC-ROC | >0.90 | Strong risk discrimination |

