## Limitations and Mitigations

| Limitation | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Training data from Weibo — may not fully represent Singapore adolescents | Fine-tune on Singapore-specific data in Phase 2 |
| Temporal features require sustained data collection | 30-day rolling window with auto-deletion |
| Cultural markers may change over time | Quarterly revalidation against counsellor outcomes |
| LSTM requires sufficient history — new users limited | Fallback to Tier 2 score for users with <7 days history |

